<title>USA: Buffets same store sales up in early Q3.</title>
<headline>Buffets same store sales up in early Q3.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buffets Inc, a restaurant operator that reported lower second quarter earnings, said Wednesday same-store sales were up slightly in the first two weeks of its third quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;...(W)e are very pleased that comparable restaurant sales for the first two weeks of the third quarter are running slightly ahead of last year, although we cannot predict whether this will continue during the remainder of the quarter,&quot; Roe Hatlen, chairman, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
